speechtext:
Of course, Mr. Chairman. But the rest of the amendment should be read also, because when you say that I want the word "should" replaced by "shall", the matter may not be very clear. The amended subclause would read as follows:
-that Canadian broadcasting system shall be effectively owned and controlled by Canadians so as to preserve and strengthen the cultural, political, social and economic fabric of Canada;
It is not, then, the management of the station-
